; RUN: spirv-as --target-env opencl2.0 %s -o %t.spv
; RUN: not llvm-spirv -r --spirv-validate --spirv-error-handling=ignore %t.spv -o %t.bc 2>&1 | FileCheck %s
; REQUIRES: libspirv_val, spirv-as

; Test the --spirv-validate functionality with an invalid SPIR-V module

; CHECK: Fails to load SPIR-V as LLVM Module: SPIR-V validation failed: No OpEntryPoint instruction was found.

               OpCapability Addresses
               OpCapability Kernel
               OpMemoryModel Physical64 OpenCL
